{
        set("short", "邪神山莊大門");
        set("long",
"                                               \n"
"                       "HIY"/----------------------/\\"NOR"                  \n"
"                     "HIY"/-----------------------/  \\"NOR"                  \n"
"                    "HIY"------------------------/    \\"NOR"                  \n"
"                  "HIY"/ |"NOR" "HIB"邪    神    山    莊"NOR""HIY" /───\\"NOR"\n"
"                    "HIY"------------------------     │"NOR"                  \n"
"                    "HIY"|| ┌───┬───┐ ||     │"NOR"                  \n"
HIY"──────────|| │      │      │ ||   ┌────────\n"NOR
"                    "HIY"|| │    Ｏ│Ｏ    │ ||   │"NOR"                  \n"
"                    "HIY"|| │      │      │ ||   │"NOR"                  \n"
"                    "HIY"|| └───┴───┘ ||   │"NOR"                  \n"
"                    "HIY"||--------------------||   │"NOR"                  \n"
"                   "HIY"--------------------------"NOR"                  \n"
"                    \n"
"這裡是傳說中的邪神山莊正門，由邪神"HIB"曠世"NOR"一手創建，在山莊四周充斥著\n"
